WEBVTT

1
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.250
In the previous verses of Chapter 16, Lord

2
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.291
Krishna exposed the tendencies
of demoniac nature

3
00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:50.916
and their self-centred

4
00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:53.458
religious conduct.

5
00:00:53.458 --> 00:00:55.791
Now in verses 16.19 and 16.20,

6
00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:58.916
He reveals where a life turned

7
00:00:58.916 --> 00:01:02.000
away from God leads.

8
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.458
This is not only outer suffering,

9
00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:07.125
but inner decline –

10
00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:11.000
a scattered mind, deep delusion, and a

11
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.916
constant drift toward degraded states.

12
00:01:18.458 --> 00:01:21.666
Lord Krishna says – those who are

13
00:01:21.666 --> 00:01:24.791
dvishatah, kruran, naradhamam, that is,

14
00:01:24.791 --> 00:01:28.833
hateful, cruel, and the lowest
among human beings,

15
00:01:28.833 --> 00:01:33.083
I ajasram asurishhu yonishhu kshipami,

16
00:01:33.083 --> 00:01:34.375
that is, again and again

17
00:01:34.375 --> 00:01:36.958
I place them in demoniac births.

18
00:01:36.958 --> 00:01:38.833
This is not arbitrary punishment,

19
00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:41.375
it is the consequence of their own choices.

20
00:01:41.375 --> 00:01:44.208
These souls keep choosing cruelty

21
00:01:44.208 --> 00:01:46.333
and envy birth after birth.

22
00:01:46.333 --> 00:01:49.416
Lord Krishna simply honours their free will

23
00:01:49.416 --> 00:01:51.791
and places them in environments

24
00:01:51.791 --> 00:01:56.041
that reflect their inner tendencies.

25
00:01:56.041 --> 00:01:58.458
Kshipami does not mean abandonment,

26
00:01:58.458 --> 00:02:01.166
but the firm form of compassion –

27
00:02:01.166 --> 00:02:03.166
like a teacher sending an undisciplined

28
00:02:03.166 --> 00:02:06.916
student to a corrective class.

29
00:02:06.916 --> 00:02:10.833
The purpose is not punishment, but reform.

30
00:02:10.833 --> 00:02:15.625
In the next verse He says, entering
demoniac births again and again,

31
00:02:15.625 --> 00:02:18.750
these mudhah mam aprapya –

32
00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:20.041
deluded ones –  failing to attain Me, 

33
00:02:20.041 --> 00:02:21.708
This is the greatest sorrow –

34
00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:24.958
mam aprapya, not reaching Me.

35
00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:27.291
This is not only pain, but the loss

36
00:02:27.291 --> 00:02:30.125
of the opportunity to connect with Lord Krishna.

37
00:02:30.125 --> 00:02:33.083
He is always

38
00:02:33.083 --> 00:02:36.375
accessible, seated in every heart.

39
00:02:36.375 --> 00:02:41.083
Yet these souls keep rejecting
Him, birth after birth.

40
00:02:41.083 --> 00:02:43.583
This is not condemnation.

41
00:02:43.583 --> 00:02:45.958
In the Vedic view, hell or a lower birth

42
00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:47.625
is not permanent punishment,

43
00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:50.416
but a corrective arrangement.

44
00:02:50.416 --> 00:02:53.916
Just as schools have remedial classes

45
00:02:53.916 --> 00:02:56.125
for undisciplined students,

46
00:02:56.125 --> 00:02:59.458
the world-order has the same.

47
00:02:59.458 --> 00:03:02.208
Even hell can become a place of learning.

48
00:03:02.208 --> 00:03:07.291
And remember, Lord Krishna abandons no soul.

49
00:03:07.291 --> 00:03:09.875
He remains a silent witness,

50
00:03:09.875 --> 00:03:14.541
ready to support even in the darkest corner.

51
00:03:14.541 --> 00:03:17.916
So these verses are not harsh condemnation,

52
00:03:17.916 --> 00:03:19.250
they are a warning.

53
00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:21.875
If we keep rejecting divinity,

54
00:03:21.875 --> 00:03:23.166
our own choices

55
00:03:23.166 --> 00:03:25.583
will take us downward.

56
00:03:25.583 --> 00:03:29.125
But the door of grace never closes.

57
00:03:29.125 --> 00:03:31.833
Lord Krishna keeps it open always,

58
00:03:31.833 --> 00:03:36.958
even for the most fallen, waiting
for their return.

59
00:03:41.666 --> 00:03:44.250
You may think –

60
00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:49.791
the worst thing in life is suffering.

61
00:03:49.791 --> 00:03:51.541
But

62
00:03:51.541 --> 00:03:52.916
I say,

63
00:03:52.916 --> 00:03:57.375
a greater loss than that

64
00:03:57.375 --> 00:04:00.125
is losing the remembrance of Me.

65
00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:02.083
This is

66
00:04:02.083 --> 00:04:05.000
mam aprapya,

67
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:09.375
not reaching Me.

68
00:04:09.375 --> 00:04:12.708
When ego overwhelms,

69
00:04:12.708 --> 00:04:15.166
cruelty becomes habit,

70
00:04:15.166 --> 00:04:18.833
and truth is mocked,

71
00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:21.291
the heart drifts

72
00:04:21.291 --> 00:04:24.750
away from its own source.

73
00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:29.833
But even then I do not leave you.

74
00:04:29.833 --> 00:04:35.333
Even if you fall in conduct, even if you deny Me,

75
00:04:35.333 --> 00:04:42.208
I remain standing calmly.

76
00:04:42.208 --> 00:04:48.208
Within you and around you, waiting.

77
00:04:48.208 --> 00:04:52.083
Not to punish,

78
00:04:52.083 --> 00:04:53.916
but to show the way.

79
00:04:53.916 --> 00:04:58.166
Life may seem dark,

80
00:04:58.166 --> 00:05:03.208
but that darkness is not eternal.

81
00:05:03.208 --> 00:05:06.291
If you find yourself, again and again,

82
00:05:06.291 --> 00:05:11.125
repeating the same tendencies,

83
00:05:11.125 --> 00:05:13.000
pause

84
00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:17.041
and ask yourself.

85
00:05:17.041 --> 00:05:18.416
‘Am I

86
00:05:18.416 --> 00:05:21.500
choosing truth,

87
00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.958
or turning away from it?’

88
00:05:24.958 --> 00:05:28.250
Even your most fallen moment

89
00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.375
can become a turning point.

90
00:05:31.375 --> 00:05:32.583
If you

91
00:05:32.583 --> 00:05:38.458
let humility become your guide.

92
00:05:38.458 --> 00:05:39.833
My door

93
00:05:39.833 --> 00:05:42.791
never closes.

94
00:05:42.791 --> 00:05:47.125
To open it, all that is needed is integrity

95
00:05:47.125 --> 00:05:49.375
and a simple heart.

96
00:05:54.166 --> 00:05:57.041
Sometimes giving a warning

97
00:05:57.041 --> 00:06:00.708
is the deepest form of love.

98
00:06:00.708 --> 00:06:02.041
I say,

99
00:06:02.041 --> 00:06:05.958
those who remain stubborn in cruelty and pride

100
00:06:05.958 --> 00:06:09.750
are placed in difficult circumstances.

101
00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.625
Not out of anger,

102
00:06:11.625 --> 00:06:14.541
but for their awakening.

103
00:06:14.541 --> 00:06:17.666
The same principle applies in the home.

104
00:06:17.666 --> 00:06:20.250
When parents hold boundaries,

105
00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:24.250
when loved ones correct,

106
00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:28.416
this is not rejection, it is protection.

107
00:06:28.416 --> 00:06:30.208
You may ignore someone's unwise

108
00:06:30.208 --> 00:06:34.000
behaviour to avoid conflict,

109
00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.625
or react with harsh

110
00:06:35.625 --> 00:06:39.083
criticism in overreaction.

111
00:06:39.083 --> 00:06:44.125
But I ask you to avoid both.

112
00:06:44.125 --> 00:06:46.458
Correct –

113
00:06:46.458 --> 00:06:52.208
with patience and care. Like

114
00:06:52.208 --> 00:06:55.208
the craftsman who makes a brass vessel

115
00:06:55.208 --> 00:06:58.000
gives support from within with wood

116
00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.416
and shapes it from outside

117
00:07:00.416 --> 00:07:01.958
with hammer blows,

118
00:07:01.958 --> 00:07:06.083
in the same way, for children, both
firm words and affection

119
00:07:06.083 --> 00:07:10.833
are necessary according to the situation.

120
00:07:10.833 --> 00:07:15.625
Just as I give ajasram, that is,

121
00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:18.875
continuous reminder,

122
00:07:18.875 --> 00:07:21.041
not to shame,

123
00:07:21.041 --> 00:07:22.875
but to show the way.

124
00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:26.000
Do not avoid difficult conversations,

125
00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:30.625
and do not mistake silence for support.

126
00:07:30.625 --> 00:07:33.500
A firm word said with love and steadiness

127
00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:39.541
can bring someone back to the right direction.

128
00:07:39.541 --> 00:07:42.958
Hold the role in your home

129
00:07:42.958 --> 00:07:47.250
that always reminds –

130
00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:49.416
you are here not to rule,

131
00:07:49.416 --> 00:07:52.708
but to lift.

132
00:07:52.708 --> 00:07:56.791
I too correct in the same way.

133
00:07:56.791 --> 00:07:59.583
Not to wound,

134
00:07:59.583 --> 00:08:01.416
but to heal.

135
00:08:06.083 --> 00:08:08.416
At the workplace, ego

136
00:08:08.416 --> 00:08:13.875
often wears the disguise of confidence.

137
00:08:13.875 --> 00:08:17.708
But when it becomes pride –

138
00:08:17.708 --> 00:08:21.666
mocking others, ignoring suggestions,

139
00:08:21.666 --> 00:08:24.750
and craving control

140
00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:28.416
at any cost –

141
00:08:28.416 --> 00:08:31.791
a heavy price is paid.

142
00:08:31.791 --> 00:08:34.375
Not only strained relationships,

143
00:08:34.375 --> 00:08:40.750
but a deep inner distance.

144
00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:45.208
Mam aprapya, that is,

145
00:08:45.208 --> 00:08:47.125
separation from Me.

146
00:08:47.125 --> 00:08:50.125
You may rise quickly.

147
00:08:50.125 --> 00:08:53.000
People may fear you

148
00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:56.791
or even praise you.

149
00:08:56.791 --> 00:09:01.125
But when you stop listening to people

150
00:09:01.125 --> 00:09:06.250
and pride becomes your compass,

151
00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:10.250
you drift away not only from people,

152
00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:15.458
but from your own conscience.

153
00:09:15.458 --> 00:09:20.583
This is where the inner foundation breaks.

154
00:09:20.583 --> 00:09:24.125
I do not punish to break

155
00:09:24.125 --> 00:09:26.291
your inner strength.

156
00:09:26.291 --> 00:09:29.541
I simply allow you to experience

157
00:09:29.541 --> 00:09:34.500
the path you have chosen.

158
00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:38.416
Even if you keep moving away from truth,

159
00:09:38.416 --> 00:09:45.083
I do not forcibly turn you around, but

160
00:09:45.083 --> 00:09:49.000
I never stop protecting you either.

161
00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:54.041
So pause for a moment.

162
00:09:54.041 --> 00:09:56.583
Ask yourself.

163
00:09:56.583 --> 00:09:59.375
Not what others think,

164
00:09:59.375 --> 00:10:02.000
but this –

165
00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:10.041
are you still connected to Me within?

166
00:10:10.041 --> 00:10:12.000
This is the difference –

167
00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.291
between true leadership

168
00:10:14.291 --> 00:10:18.708
and hollow success.

169
00:10:18.708 --> 00:10:22.458
Stay close to that inner voice.

170
00:10:22.458 --> 00:10:29.416
Then you will be fully protected from decline.

171
00:10:29.416 --> 00:10:30.583
Reflect on this.
